# Environment check: three requests, three JSON responses, cleared for the day.
# Works in VS Code (REST Client extension) and JetBrains IDEs. Curl versions in README.md.
#
# For request 3, fill in the three values from the card handed out at the door.

### 1. Local chat (powers Blocks 1 and 3)
POST http://localhost:11434/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Reply with exactly: TRAILHEAD OK" }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### 2. Local embeddings (powers Block 2 and anomaly detection)
POST http://localhost:11434/api/embed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "nomic-embed-text",
  "input": "A quiet trail along the lake shore."
}

### 3. Cloud chat (powers sentiment comparison, RAG generation, and the capstone)
# Replace ENDPOINT, DEPLOYMENT, and YOUR-KEY with the values from your card.
POST https://ENDPOINT/openai/deployments/DEPLOYMENT/chat/completions?api-version=2024-10-21
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: YOUR-KEY

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Reply with exactly: TRAILHEAD CLOUD OK" }
  ]
}
